OL,3,CUK braced for more wildfires as fourth
OL,4,Cheatwave looms
OL,6,FEmergency services are braced for
OL,7,Ffurther wildfires as the UK's fourth
OL,8,Fheatwave looms.
OL,10,FAt the height of the third heatwave,
OL,11,Fin mid-July, firefighters were
OL,12,Fbattling 19 significant wildfires
OL,13,Fsimultaneously in England and Wales.
OL,15,FMeanwhile, blazes have wrought
OL,16,Fdestruction in mainland Europe this
OL,17,Fweek, with 220,000 forced out of their
OL,18,Fhomes in south-west France and 116,000
OL,19,Fevacuated in Spain.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
