OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785169122
OL,3,CUK braced for more wildfires as fourth
OL,4,Cheatwave looms
OL,6,FThis comes as a Met Office
OL,7,Fmeteorologist said UK heatwave
OL,8,Fthresholds will need to be adjusted to
OL,9,Ftake into account the warming climate,
OL,10,Fwhich has seen temperature records
OL,11,Frepeatedly broken this year.
OL,13,FA National Fire Chiefs Council (NFCC)
OL,14,Fspokesperson said: "With the Met
OL,15,FOffice warning that a fourth heatwave
OL,16,Fcould develop this week, bringing
OL,17,Fanother period of very hot weather to
OL,18,Fparts of the UK, fire and rescue
OL,19,Fservices remain on alert and are
OL,20,Fcontinuing to prepare for renewed
OL,21,Fwildfire risk."
OL,26,@vD@TOU}D@OO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
