CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785169122
OL,3,CUK braced for more wildfires as fourth
OL,4,Cheatwave looms
OL,6,FBattling nearly 20 wildfires at once
OL,7,Fdemonstrates "the scale of the
OL,8,Fchallenge posed by the prolonged hot,
OL,9,Fdry conditions", they added.
OL,11,F"Most wildfires are preventable and we
OL,12,Fare asking everyone to play their part
OL,13,Fin helping to protect our communities,
OL,14,Fwildlife and natural spaces, while
OL,15,Feasing the pressure on firefighters
OL,16,Fwho have already faced an
OL,17,Fexceptionally challenging summer."
OL,19,FTemperatures cooled, winds picked up
OL,20,Fand a smattering of rain fell for many
OL,21,Fduring the weekend.
OL,26,@oD@NOUqD@OO]sD@AOUyD@bO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
