OL,3,CUK braced for more wildfires as fourth
OL,4,Cheatwave looms
OL,6,FBut parts of southern England will yet
OL,7,Fagain meet their heatwave criteria on
OL,8,FWednesday, which could reach highs of
OL,9,F32C or 33C, and more will on Thursday.
OL,11,FA yellow heat alert has been issued
OL,12,Ffrom 9am on Tuesday to 9am on Friday
OL,13,Ffor the East and West Midlands, the
OL,14,Fsouth-east, south-west and east of
OL,15,FEngland, as well as Yorkshire and the
OL,16,FHumber.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
