OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785169122
OL,3,CUK braced for more wildfires as fourth
OL,4,Cheatwave looms
OL,6,FThe UK Health Security Agency (UKHSA)
OL,7,Fissued a warning of possible
OL,8,F"significant impacts" on health and
OL,9,Fsocial care services, including a rise
OL,10,Fin deaths among the elderly or people
OL,11,Fwith health conditions, and an
OL,12,Fincrease in drownings.
OL,14,FForecasters are expecting this week's
OL,15,Fhot spell to be a "north-south split",
OL,16,Fwith clouds and outbreaks of rain
OL,17,Fcontinuing in Northern Ireland,
OL,18,FScotland and northern England.
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@UO]wD@SOUwD@eO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
