OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785169122
OL,3,CUK braced for more wildfires as fourth
OL,4,Cheatwave looms
OL,6,FBut the peak will be "almost a blink
OL,7,Fand you miss it", with temperatures
OL,8,Fwidely cooling close to average by the
OL,9,Fweekend, said senior Met Office
OL,10,Fmeteorologist Dan Stroud.
OL,12,FJuly was 3C above average across the
OL,13,FUK, according to provisional Met
OL,14,FOffice data on the month so far.
OL,16,FThis could put it among the hottest
OL,17,Fthree or four months of July on
OL,18,Frecord, said Mr Stroud.
OL,26,@nD@VOUoD@PO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
