CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785169122
OL,3,CUK braced for more wildfires as fourth
OL,4,Cheatwave looms
OL,6,FHeatwave thresholds for some counties
OL,7,Fwere nudged up by a degree four or
OL,8,Ffive years ago, said senior Met Office
OL,9,Fmeteorologist Marco Petagna.
OL,11,F"Going forward they'll need to be
OL,12,Fadjusted to take into account...
OL,13,Fcurrent climate, otherwise we're going
OL,14,Fto more frequently go into heatwaves.
OL,15,FIt's a moveable thing, really, as we
OL,16,Fgo through a warming world", he added.
OL,18,FSouthern England has had just 1% of
OL,19,Fits average July rainfall. England has
OL,20,Fhad 5% and the UK as a whole 20%,
OL,21,Faccording to the Met Office.
OL,26,@sD@AOUxD@[O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/9
