FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785169122
OL,3,CUK braced for more wildfires as fourth
OL,4,Cheatwave looms
OL,6,FThe dry spell has contributed to low-
OL,7,Fwater levels and North Wales and the
OL,8,FUpper Severn became the first part of
OL,9,Fthe UK to declare drought status on
OL,10,FThursday.
OL,12,FIn addition, fires, if they start, are
OL,13,Flikely to become exceptionally severe
OL,14,Fon Wednesday in pockets of the east,
OL,15,Fsouth, and south-east England,
OL,16,Faccording to Met Office data used by
OL,17,FNatural England and Natural Resources
OL,18,FWales.
OL,20,FThe "exceptionally severe" warnings
OL,21,Ffocus on eastern England on Thursday.
OL,26,@|D@EOU|D@ZO]
