PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785169122
OL,3,CUK braced for more wildfires as fourth
OL,4,Cheatwave looms
OL,6,FThe Fire Severity Index looks at data
OL,7,Fincluding rainfall, temperature and
OL,8,Fhumidity and agencies use it to assess
OL,9,Fthe severity of fire if it starts. It
OL,10,Fdoes not cover the chances of
OL,11,Fwildfires occurring.
OL,13,FEmergency crews have already spent
OL,14,Fdays fighting large wildfires in Wales
OL,15,Fand Scotland that forced people to
OL,16,Fevacuate from their homes.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/9
